### Get all articles
GET http://localhost:8080/article
Accept: application/json

### Get order Allerts @deprecated
POST http://localhost:8080/order_alerts
Accept: application/json

{
    "global_current_stock": 10,
    "global_min_stock": 3
}

### Get forecast for article
POST http://localhost:8080/forecast
Accept: application/json

{
    "article_id": "9101DX",
    "current_stock_for_article": 50,
    "min_stock_for_article": 3
}

### Get most critical alerts
POST http://localhost:8080/alerts
Accept: application/json

{
    "global_current_stock": 50,
    "global_min_stock": 3,
    "amount_of_alerts": 3
}

### Get global forecast
GET http://localhost:8080/global-forecast
Accept: application/json